  "description": "Emeliette is determined to have a loving family in her second life, but that's much easier said than done when her mother has passed away and her father, Duke Cardin vel Vardion, is cold and absent. So when the duke finally comes back into her lonely life, Emeliette gives her all to win his heart with her cuteness. As she grows closer to her father, she begins to realize her parents' legacy is greater than she ever imagined and that she herself may be a girl worthy of her own story. \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
